# Ready-made requests for VS Code (REST Client extension) or Visual Studio.
# 1. Run "Send code", copy devCode from the response into @code.
# 2. Run "Sign in", copy accessToken into @token.

@api = https://localhost:7001/api/v1
@mobile = 9999999999
@code = 000000
@token = paste-access-token-here

### Lists for the forms (no sign-in)
GET {{api}}/reference-data

### Price estimate (no sign-in)
POST {{api}}/price-estimates
Content-Type: application/json

{ "pickupCityId": 1, "dropCityId": 6, "vehicleTypeId": 4, "weightKg": 3000 }

### Send code
POST {{api}}/auth/otp
Content-Type: application/json

{ "mobile": "{{mobile}}", "purpose": "Login" }

### Sign in
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "mobile": "{{mobile}}", "code": "{{code}}" }

### My profile
GET {{api}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Admin dashboard
GET {{api}}/dashboards/admin
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Bookings (page 1, 20 per page)
GET {{api}}/bookings?pageNumber=1&pageSize=20&status=Confirmed
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Approvals queue
GET {{api}}/approvals
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Trips waiting for POD approval
GET {{api}}/trips?status=Delivered
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Users
GET {{api}}/users?search=ravi&role=Owner
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Health
GET https://localhost:7001/health
